      "id": "K3",
      "title": "Older than the discovery（墓の発見より古い呪い）",
      "text": "The mummy's curse is older than the discovery of Tutankhamun's tomb. In 1869, Louisa May Alcott, the author of Little Women, published a story called \"Lost in a Pyramid; or, The Mummy's Curse.\" That was more than fifty years before Howard Carter found the tomb.",
